  "body": "In particular it says:\r\n\r\n> The [resulting URL string](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#resulting-url-string) determined during the [fetch and process the linked resource](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#fetch-and-process-the-linked-resource) algorithm.\r\n\r\nThis algorithm has access to a response. So maybe serializing response's URL list[0] would do (although should this even be serialized?), but need to double check that always has the correct value. Alternatively we could just parse `href` again. Should be idempotent.",
